    "updated_at": "2015-12-22T11:52:20Z",
    "body": "The SVGs are not DRY, but the shapes are really simple, and it seems good to have them be self-contained. Though I suppose they could use `<g>` and `transform` and maybe `<use>`?\n\nThe SVGs have no accessibility stuff yet. They are all redundant with the text above them, technically, but I'm not sure if they should have `role=\"presentation\"` or `role=\"img\"` plus something else.\n",
