    "updated_at": "2015-12-22T13:32:13Z",
    "body": "> The SVGs have no accessibility stuff yet. They are all redundant with the text above them, technically, but I'm not sure if they should have role=\"presentation\" or role=\"img\" plus something else.\n\nWent with `role=\"img\"` and `aria-label`, like the #abstract image. Tested with VO.\n",
