    "body": "@zcorpan I got the properties mixed up in a previous round: dominant-baseline=middle is probably close to what you need in this context, alignment-baseline is for children like tspan aligning with a text parent. (Seems to be interoperability issues hiding here...) Thanks for the patience!\n",
